      "content": "\"slip away\"... you mean just leaving it all behind? i guess i see what you mean, about sparing people the sight of me hitting rock bottom. there's a certain kind of dignity in stopping before the damage is total, before i become a complete joke to everyone who ever respected me. is that what you're saying? that sometimes the most controlled thing a person can do is just decide when the story ends?",
